### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@tokenGarcia = tok-garcia-familia-2026
@tokenAnaDiego = tok-ana-diego-2026

# IDs del seed para la Familia García
@carlosGuestId = cc111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111101
@sofiaGuestId  = cc222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222202
@pabloGuestId  = cc333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333303

# IDs de eventos del seed
@ceremonyEventId = e1111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111101
@cocktailEventId = e2222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222202
@banquetEventId  = e3333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333303
@partyEventId    = e4444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444404

# IDs de menús del Banquete
@menuStdId   = a1111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111101
@menuVegId   = a2222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222202
@menuChildId = a4444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444404


### =========================================================================
### ENDPOINTS PÚBLICOS DE RSVP (Invitados mediante Token Único)
### =========================================================================

### 1. Obtener información de la invitación para la Familia García
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/rsvp/{{tokenGarcia}}

### 2. Obtener información de la invitación para Ana y Diego
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/rsvp/{{tokenAnaDiego}}

### 3. Enviar confirmación de asistencia completa (Familia García)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/rsvp/{{tokenGarcia}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guests": [
    {
      "guestId": "{{carlosGuestId}}",
      "dietaryRequirements": "Sin frutos secos",
      "events": [
        {
          "eventId": "{{ceremonyEventId}}",
          "attending": true,
          "specialNotes": "Llegaremos en transporte público"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "{{cocktailEventId}}",
          "attending": true
        },
        {
          "eventId": "{{banquetEventId}}",
          "attending": true,
          "menuOptionId": "{{menuStdId}}"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "{{partyEventId}}",
          "attending": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "guestId": "{{sofiaGuestId}}",
      "dietaryRequirements": "Vegetariana",
      "events": [
        {
          "eventId": "{{ceremonyEventId}}",
          "attending": true
        },
        {
          "eventId": "{{cocktailEventId}}",
          "attending": true
        },
        {
          "eventId": "{{banquetEventId}}",
          "attending": true,
          "menuOptionId": "{{menuVegId}}"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "{{partyEventId}}",
          "attending": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "guestId": "{{pabloGuestId}}",
      "events": [
        {
          "eventId": "{{ceremonyEventId}}",
          "attending": true
        },
        {
          "eventId": "{{cocktailEventId}}",
          "attending": true
        },
        {
          "eventId": "{{banquetEventId}}",
          "attending": true,
          "menuOptionId": "{{menuChildId}}",
          "specialNotes": "Necesita trona"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "{{partyEventId}}",
          "attending": false
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### 4. Enviar declinación de asistencia (Ana y Diego)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/rsvp/{{tokenAnaDiego}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guests": [
    {
      "guestId": "cc444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444404",
      "events": [
        {
          "eventId": "{{cocktailEventId}}",
          "attending": false,
          "specialNotes": "Nos coincide con un viaje fuera del país"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "{{banquetEventId}}",
          "attending": false
        },
        {
          "eventId": "{{partyEventId}}",
          "attending": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "guestId": "cc555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555505",
      "events": [
        {
          "eventId": "{{cocktailEventId}}",
          "attending": false
        },
        {
          "eventId": "{{banquetEventId}}",
          "attending": false
        },
        {
          "eventId": "{{partyEventId}}",
          "attending": false
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}


### =========================================================================
### ENDPOINTS DE ADMINISTRACIÓN (Panel Privado)
### =========================================================================

### 5. Consultar métricas y estadísticas globales de asistencia (RSVP Dashboard)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/rsvp/stats


### =========================================================================
### CASOS DE ERROR Y VALIDACIONES
### =========================================================================

### 6. 404 - Token inexistente o inválido
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/rsvp/token-que-no-existe-12345

### 7. 400 - Lista de invitados vacía al enviar RSVP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/rsvp/{{tokenGarcia}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guests": []
}

### 8. 400 - Invitado intenta responder a un evento al que su Party no está convocada
# Ana y Diego no están convocados a la Ceremonia Civil
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/rsvp/{{tokenAnaDiego}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guests": [
    {
      "guestId": "cc444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444404",
      "events": [
        {
          "eventId": "{{ceremonyEventId}}",
          "attending": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### 9. 400 - Opción de menú que no pertenece al evento
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/rsvp/{{tokenGarcia}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guests": [
    {
      "guestId": "{{carlosGuestId}}",
      "events": [
        {
          "eventId": "{{ceremonyEventId}}",
          "attending": true,
          "menuOptionId": "{{menuStdId}}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
